  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 1em; outline: none; padding: 0px; transition: all; vertical-align: baseline;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: none; padding: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: none; vertical-align: baseline;\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">🎈 שִׂיחָה בְּסְמָלִים – \"אֲנִי יוֹסֵף\"</span></span></h2><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👑 <b>יוֹסֵף</b> (רוֹעֵד מֵהִתְרַגְּשׁוּת):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָאַחִים שֶׁלִּי עוֹמְדִים מוּלִי, וְהֵם לֹא מַכִּירִים אוֹתִי...</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַלֵּב מִתְפּוֹצֵץ! כָּל הַשָּׁנִים חִכִּיתִי לָרֶגַע הַזֶּה.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🧔 <b>יְהוּדָה</b> (מִתְחַנֵּן):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּבַקָּשָׁה&nbsp; אֲדֹנִי! אֲנִי מִתְחַנֵּן – אַל תִּקַּח אֶת בִּנְיָמִין!</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי אֶהְיֶה עֶבֶד בִּמְקוֹמוֹ.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🏆 <b>גְּבִיעַ הַכֶּסֶף</b> (בִּמְבוּכָה):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי הִתְחַלְתִּי אֶת כָּל הַמְּהוּמָה...</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל בְּעֶזְרָתִי תִּבָּחֵן הָאַחְוָה.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">💰 <b>הַכֶּסֶף</b> (לוֹחֵשׁ):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּעַם חָזַרְתִּי לַשַּׂקִּים.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹסֵף רָצָה לָדַעַת אִם הַלֵּב שֶׁל הָאַחִים הִשְׁתַּנָּה.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👘 <b>בֶּגֶד הַמֶּלֶךְ</b> (בַּחֲשִׁיבוּת):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּעַם הָיִיתִי כְּתֹנֶת פַּסִּים, הַיּוֹם אֲנִי גְּלִימָה מַלְכוּתִית.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל בְתוֹךְ הַבֶּגֶד – נִשְׁאַר אוֹתוֹ נַעַר טָהוֹר.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🏛️ <b>אַרְמוֹן פַּרְעֹה</b> (מַקְשִׁיב):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִמֶּרְחָק שָׁמַעְתִּי בֶּכִי שֶׁל אַהֲבָה –</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל הַשָּׂרִים בּוֹכִים בְּהִתְרַגְּשׁוּת עִם יוֹסֵף וְאֶחָיו!</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👨‍👩‍👦&nbsp; <b>הָאַחִים</b> (נִבְהָלִים וּמִתְקָרְבִים):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מָה?! אַתָּה יוֹסֵף?!</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִי אֶפְשָׁר לְהַאֲמִין - אֲבָל הַדְּמָעוֹת אֲמִתִּיּוֹת.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🚚 <b>הָעֲגָלָה</b> (מִתְגַּלְגֶּלֶת בְּשִׂמְחָה):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוֹסֵף שָׁלַח אוֹתִי לְהָבִיא אֶל יַעֲקֹב אָבִיו!</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּשֶׁהַצַּדִּיק רָאָה אוֹתִי – רוּחוֹ שָׁבָה אֵלָיו!</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">💞 <b>הַלֵּב שֶׁל יְהוּדָה</b> (מִתְפַּעֵם):</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּעַם חָטָאנוּ – עַכְשָׁיו תִּקַּנּוּ.</span></p><p data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"358\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַחִים נִשְׁאָרִים אַחִים – גַּם אַחֲרֵי כָּל הַבֶּכִי.</span></p><div style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תפזורת נכדים</span></span></h2></div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו את 🔍 שמות נכדי יעקב: חֲנוֹךְ, חֶצְרֹן, יְמוּאֵל, יָמִין, אֹהַד, גֵּרְשׁוֹן, קְהָת, מְרָרִי, שֵׁלָה, פֶרֶץ, זָרַח.</span><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></span><br /><a href=\"/assets/images/content/22dd0759266f2c6d01.png\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/22dd0759266f2c6d01.png\" /></a><br /><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יהודה ניגש אל יוסף וביקש לשחרר את בנימין?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כשאמר \"אֲנִי יוֹסֵף\", האחים מיד שמחו וצחקו מרוב אושר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוסף סלח לאחיו ואמר שהכול נעשה מאת ה'?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פרעה שמע על בוא האחים ושמח על האיחוד המשפחתי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פוטיפר ציווה לגרש את האחים ממצרים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יוסף נתן לבנימין פי 5 מתנות יותר משאר האחים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יעקב לא האמין בתחילה שיוסף חי?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יעקב שלח את ראובן להקדים ולהכין את הדרך למצרים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פרעה נתן לאחי יוסף עגלות כדי להביא את משפחתם?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כל משפחת יעקב ירדה למצרים – שבעים נפש?</span></li></ol></div></div><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; clear: both; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/22dd0759266f2c6d01.png\" style=\"background-color: initial; clear: right; float: right; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: large; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><div style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: start; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"></div></span></span></div></a></span></span></div></div>"
}
